{"id":"wb-7-1699","name":"黄山炮台旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"黄山炮台旧址","text":"黄山炮台旧址位于中国江苏省江阴市，建于1635年。是江阴要塞最重要的组成部分。\n炮台参与过鸦片战争等战役。民国初年时，由土炮台改建为洋炮台，抗日时被毁，后由国民政府重建。2013年5月，黄山炮台旧址被选为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BB%84%E5%B1%B1%E7%82%AE%E5%8F%B0%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":84956878,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84956878","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/114080de9d3274a4074022b0.jpg","title":"Jiangyin,_Wuxi,_Jiangsu,_China_-_panoramio_(49).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jiangyin,_Wuxi,_Jiangsu,_China_-_panoramio_(49).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3a/Jiangyin%2C_Wuxi%2C_Jiangsu%2C_China_-_panoramio_%2849%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"song songroov","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","caption":"Jiangyin, Wuxi, Jiangsu, China","width":320,"height":180}}